-- WoW Forever: The Shaper's Terrace (map 3001, levels 58-60) trash, patrols and boss rooms laid out again on the real floor.
-- Every spawn here is HAND-PLACED: no sniff of this dungeon exists yet. When a sniff comes, replace this whole file
-- (guids 48140000-48140199, their formations and waypoint paths 481400000-481401999) with the sniffed spawns.
-- How it was built:
--  * the floor is the server's own navmesh for map 3001; every creature stands on the walkable mesh joined to the
--    landing, at the floor's height, clear of walls (the old file had 17 of 82 off the floor);
--  * packs of 2-4 every ~58 yd along the way from the landing through all eleven bosses, in the order the bots take;
--    each pack's kinds come from the creatures that already stood in that part of the terrace in 2026_11_19_72
--    (Everlake's Forever dungeon work, github.com/buildthehomelab, GPL); the big beasts (Devilsaurs, Tyranosaur,
--    Thunderstomp Stegodon) walk or stand alone;
--  * packs are linked (creature_formations groupAI 3); the Devilsaurs and the Tyranosaur roam three valleys;
--  * the bosses keep their spots (the bot route uses them); Izha'Rel stands by her mate Tor'Rel, King Op's gorillas inside
--    his 30 yd call range;
--  * the quest kill counts are covered: 7 Ravasaur Matriarchs (6 needed) by Tor'Rel, 11 Ironhide Ravasaurs (9 needed)
--    in the tar by the landing (so 2026_11_19_89's move out of the tar is kept).
-- Runs after 2026_11_19_72 and 2026_11_19_89 and replaces their creature rows. Safe to run again.

DELETE FROM `creature_formations` WHERE `leaderGUID` BETWEEN 48140000 AND 48140199 OR `memberGUID` BETWEEN 48140000 AND 48140199;
DELETE FROM `creature_addon` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 48140000 AND 48140199;
DELETE FROM `waypoint_path_node` WHERE `PathId` BETWEEN 481400000 AND 481401999;
DELETE FROM `waypoint_path` WHERE `PathId` BETWEEN 481400000 AND 481401999;
DELETE FROM `creature` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 48140000 AND 48140199;
